/-- **AN AUTOMORPHISM FIXING THE INTEGRAL CLOSURE POINTWISE IS THE IDENTITY**
(PROVEN 2026-07-27).  `L = Frac(𝒪_L)` for a finite subextension of `ℚ₃ᵥᵃˡᵍ/ℚ₃ᵥ`
