/-- **`(P_{3/2})` FORCES THE RAMIFICATION BOUND, and the bound descends
to subextensions** (sorry node, created 2026-07-26 — leaf (ii-a′-3-c),
PURE local ramification theory: no algebra `A`, no differentials, no
