are all `𝒪₃ᵥ/3`, so `Ω¹` is FREE over `G/3G` — a fortiori flat.  Note
that (2) is stated here WITHOUT assuming `hΩ`, and is still true: the
tensor `G/3G ⊗_G Ω¹` is `ω_G/3 ⊗_{𝒪₃ᵥ/3} G/3G`, free over `G/3G` of
