has `v` in the support of its image under `𝔑` at all.

  Witness. `F = ℚ(i)`, `𝓞 F = ℤ[i]`, `mm = (2+i)` (so `absNorm mm = 5`),
  `E = F` with `ι = id`, `j = id`, `jE = algebraMap`, `m = 3`,
  `mmE = span {(15 : ℤ[i])}`, `χ ≡ 1` (so `hmmram` is vacuous and `hcyc`
