  (`E = F`, `under W = W`, `f = 1`), so `𝔑 (Im') = Im'`. But
  `5 = (2+i)(2−i) ∈ v`, hence `15 ∈ v`, hence `v ∣ mmE`, hence every `x ∈ Im'`
