separately ownable leaves from the unbounded one.

FAITHFULNESS (audited 2026-07-26, statement UNCHANGED). Numerically
sanity-checked with PARI/GP at `F = ℚ(√3)` (`h = 1`, `Cl⁺ ≅ ℤ/2`,
