/-- **Everywhere-unramified characters of `Γ_{ℚ(x)}` square to one
when every ideal square of `𝓞_{ℚ(x)}` is narrowly principal — the pure
reciprocity sub-leaf** (DECOMPOSED 2026-07-24 — the whole `Γ ℚ ↔ Γ F`
