modulo squares `μ₆/μ₆² = {±1}` (`ω = (ω²)²`), so
`α ∈ {1, -1, π₃, -π₃}·Fˣ²`. The three nontrivial classes are all
RAMIFIED at `𝔮₂`: in the unramified local field `K₂ = ℚ₂(ω)`
(`e = 1`), a quadratic class is unramified iff it meets
