K₂[z]/(z² - z - c)` with `z = (1+√(1+4c))/2`, integral and separable
mod `2`); the square of a unit of `ℤ₂[ω]` mod `4` depends only on the
unit mod `2` (`(u+2t)² ≡ u² mod 4`), giving unit squares mod `4`
